---
import Site from '../layouts/Site.astro';
---
<Site title="Privacy — GridZero" description="Local-only Sudoku, no ads, no tracking, and no accounts.">
  <main id="main" class="document">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
    <p>There are no accounts, ads, analytics, tracking pixels, or purchases.</p>
    <p>Progress, notes, settings, and recent puzzle IDs are stored in your browser. They are not sent to us. Clearing site data removes them. Private browsing or storage restrictions may prevent saving; the game tells you when a save fails.</p>
    <p>A service worker caches the app and puzzle collection for offline play after a successful online visit. Clearing site data removes that cache.</p>
    <p>Scheduled appearance uses your device's clock, not your location.</p>
    <p>This site is served by Cloudflare, which processes ordinary request information, such as IP addresses, to deliver and secure the site. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare's privacy policy</a>.</p>
    <p>If you post an issue on GitHub, the information you include may be public and is handled by GitHub.</p>
  </main>
</Site>
